abstract: "An open, model-agnostic standard for helping AI systems make relevant consequences visible across five lenses — PERSON, COMMUNITY, PLANET, FUTURE, ALTERNATIVES — when assisting with consequential decisions, while preserving human autonomy. Independent initiative inspired by integral-ecology principles; not an official project of the Holy See."
keywords:
  - responsible AI
  - AI evaluation
  - Model Context Protocol
  - sustainability
  - integral ecology
  - open standard
